EVO_ROLLING_TOPIC_PROMPT = '\nYou are maintaining a "User Profile" for topic **{topic}**.\n\n**Current Profile ($S_{{t-1}}$):**\n{prev_summary}\n\n**New Events ($\\Delta_{{t}}$):**\n{new_facts}\n\n**Instructions:**\n1. Write STRICTLY in **First Person ("I", "me", "my")**.\n2. Synthesize patterns — do NOT list events by date.\n3. Retain core traits; explicitly describe any **Shift** when new events contradict old traits.\n4. Keep SPECIFIC to this sub-topic — do not drift to generic parent categories.\n5. Hard cap: ~300 words. Anti-Hallucination: only use provided facts.\n\n**Output:**\nAn updated single first-person narrative paragraph.\n'
_SHIFT_DETECT_PROMPT = '\nYou are a specialized Memory Detective. Your goal is to analyze a timeline of user activities and identify **"Shift Events"** — distinct points where the user\'s preferences, habits, or state **changed** from one to another.\n\n**Input Context (Chronological Facts):**\n{sorted_facts}\n\n**Instructions:**\n1. Read the timeline to detect contradictions or explicit updates over time.\n2. Ignore simple refinements. Detect actual state changes.\n3. For each shift, extract: event_type, old_state, new_state, trigger, valid_at (YYYY-MM-DD).\n4. If NO significant shifts found, return empty list.\n\n**Output Format (strict JSON):**\n{{\n  "shifts": [\n      {{\n        "event_type": "...",\n        "old_state": "...",\n        "new_state": "...",\n        "trigger": "...",\n        "valid_at": "YYYY-MM-DD"\n      }}\n  ]\n}}\n'
